unes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:36.771" end="0:37.267">想念</span><span begin="0:37.267" end="0:37.491">your</span> <span begin="0:37.491" end="0:37.659">big</span> <span begin="0:37.659" end="0:38.085">brown</span> <span begin="0:38.085" end="0:38.523">eyes</span> <span begin="0:38.533" end="0:39.248">可爱的</span><span begin="0:39.248" end="0:39.728">lips,</span> <span begin="0:39.728" end="0:39.968">I</span> <span begin="0:39.968" end="0:40.584">wanna</span> <span begin="0:40.584" end="0:41.091">kiss</span></p><p begin="0:41.388" end="0:44.124" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:41.388" end="0:41.703">I</span> <span begin="0:41.703" end="0:42.105">miss</span> <span begin="0:42.105" end="0:43.593">想一直牵着你的</span><span begin="0:43.593" end="0:44.124">手</span></p><p begin="0:44.307" end="0:47.533" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:44.307" end="0:45.163">但我还年</span><span begin="0:45.163" end="0:45.550">轻</span><span begin="0:45.550" end="0:46.048">心不</span><span begin="0:46.048" end="0:46.465">定</span> <span begin="0:46.475" end="0:46.982">又能</span><span begin="0:46.982" end="0:47.176">怎么</span><span begin="0:47.176" end="0:47.533">办</span></p><p begin="0:47.903" end="0:52.616" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:47.903" end="0:48.932">Boy</span> <span begin="0:49.186" end="0:49.773">有什么</span><span begin="0:49.773" end="0:50.224">话</span><span begin="0:50.224" end="0:50.565">开</span><span begin="0:50.565" end="0:51.365">不了</span><span begin="0:51.365" end="0:52.616">口</span></p><p begin="0:51.867" end="0:54.617" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:51.867" end="0:52.067">No</span> <span begin="0:52.067" end="0:52.652">worries</span> <span begin="0:52.662" end="0:54.171">我只是用脑想过</span><span begin="0:54.171" end="0:54.617">头</span></p><p begin="0:54.637" end="0:58.318" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:54.637" end="0:55.930">拥有了又想自</span><span begin="0:55.930" end="0:56.365">由</span> <span begin="0:56.3